---
<SiteLayout {...metadata}>
    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container hero-grid">
          <div>
            <h1>
              蔡泓恩｜職能治療師<br />
              <span>把臨床觀察轉化為復健工具</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="hero-copy">
              目前就讀臺大職能治療碩士班，研究雙眼視覺、深度知覺與眼球動作；同時在台灣視覺復健專業服務協會擔任研究助理，負責視覺評估與復健。臨床與研究中反覆出現的問題，我會寫成練習工具或自動化流程。
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="button-primary" href="/blog">閱讀專業文章</a>
              <a class="button-secondary" href="mailto:rainbowh9490@gmail.com">寫信給我</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="portrait">
            <img src="/assets/ian-tsai.jpg" alt="蔡泓恩，職能治療師" width="1271" height="1747" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section section-muted" aria-labelledby="focus-title">
        <div class="container split">
          <div class="split-intro">
            <h2 id="focus-title">專業領域</h2>
            <p>這三項是我在臨床、研究與開源專案中持續投入的方向。</p>
          </div>
          <dl class="focus-list">
            <div>
              <dt>視覺復健</dt>
              <dd>針對視野缺損、半側忽略與眼球動作控制問題，設計視覺掃描與注意力訓練。</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>功能性評估</dt>
              <dd>從日常活動需求出發，辨識影響獨立生活的視覺障礙，作為治療計畫的基準。</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>數位健康工具</dt>
              <dd>把門診叫號追蹤、文獻搜尋與論文整理等重複工作寫成工具，減少行政時間。</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="academic-title">
        <div class="container">
          <h2 id="academic-title" class="section-title">學術成果</h2>
          <p class="academic-section-lead">
            以臨床實務與復能需求為出發點，聚焦於雙眼視覺、深度知覺評估、低視能輔具處方與神經視覺損傷復健的實證研究。
          </p>

          <div class="academic-layout">
            <article class="academic-thesis-card">
              <div class="academic-thesis-header">
                <span class="academic-badge">{thesisProject.category}</span>
                <span class="academic-status">{thesisProject.status}</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="academic-thesis-title">{thesisProject.title}</h3>
              <div class="academic-thesis-meta">
                <span>{thesisProject.institution}</span>
                <span>·</span>
                <span>{thesisProject.advisor}</span>
              </div>
              <p class="academic-thesis-desc">{thesisProject.summary}</p>
              <ul class="academic-thesis-points">
                {thesisProject.highlights.map((point) => (
                  <li>{point}</li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </article>

            <div>
              <h3 class="academic-subheading">研討會發表與論文</h3>
              <div class="academic-list">
                {publications.map((item) => (
                  <article class="academic-card">
                    <div class="academic-card-header">
                      <span class:list={['academic-badge', item.badgeClass]}>{item.type}</span>
                      <time class="academic-date" datetime={item.date.replace('/', '-')}>{item.date}</time>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="academic-card-title">{item.title}</h4>
                    <div class="academic-conference">{item.conference}</div>
                    <div class="academic-authors">
                      <span class="academic-author-label">作者：</span>
                      <span>{item.authors}</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="academic-card-desc">{item.summary}</p>
                  </article>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="trainerhub-title">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="platform-highlight">
            <div class="platform-highlight-copy">
              <h2 id="trainerhub-title">TrainerHub 居家復健訓練網</h2>
              <p>
                居家練習工具與衛教資訊的整合入口，提供動作、視覺、認知與口腔練習。原始碼公開在 GitHub 的 RehabTrainerHub 專案。
              </p>
              <a class="button-primary" href="https://trainerhub.cc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                開啟 TrainerHub
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">open_in_new</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <ul class="platform-facts">
              <li><strong>練習模組</strong>動作、視覺、認知與口腔練習，另附衛教資訊。</li>
              <li><strong>練習紀錄</strong>可設定練習參數，成績匯出為 CSV。</li>
              <li><strong>開發者遊戲庫</strong>審核通過的 jsPsych 遊戲在獨立網域執行。</li>
              <li><strong>使用方式</strong>以瀏覽器開啟，也可安裝為 PWA。</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
        <div class="container">
          <h2 id="experience-title" class="section-title">學經歷</h2>
          <div class="timeline-columns">
            <div>
              <h3 class="timeline-heading">工作經歷</h3>
              <div class="timeline">
                {work.map((item) => (
                  <article class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-period">{item.period}</div>
                    <h4>{item.title}</h4>
                    <div class="timeline-org">{item.org}</div>
                    <p>{item.description}</p>
                  </article>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="timeline-heading">學歷</h3>
              <div class="timeline">
                {education.map((item) => (
                  <article class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-period">{item.period}</div>
                    <h4>{item.title}</h4>
                    <div class="timeline-org">{item.org}</div>
                    <p>{item.description}</p>
                  </article>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
</SiteLayout>
